# SEO Articles Directory

Place your article drafts here for AI detection checking.

## Workflow

1. Write draft: `articles/pomodoro-guide-v1.md`
2. Check: `npm run ai-check -- --file articles/pomodoro-guide-v1.md`
3. Revise based on feedback
4. Repeat 3 times until score > 80%

## File Naming Convention

- `{topic}-v1.md` - First draft
- `{topic}-v2.md` - After first revision
- `{topic}-v3.md` - Final version
